# the same program with typed slots withheld: every field lies in a slot that holds any value, in the order of declaration, eight bytes each
# RUN: plan layouts mechanisms=none+TypedOperations+UnboxedNumbers
# CHECK: layout L0 CompiledObject
# CHECK-NEXT: slot 0 "x" JSValue Inline offset=[[x]] record=0
# CHECK-NEXT: slot 1 "y" JSValue Inline offset=[[y]] record=1
# RUN(NONE): plan layouts mechanisms=none
# NONE: mechanisms none
# NONE: layout L0 CompiledObject
# NONE-NEXT: slot 0 "x" JSValue Inline
# NONE-NEXT: slot 1 "y" JSValue Inline
# PROGRAM-OF: field-that-holds-numbers-alone-is-a-double.ir
